          "run_on": {
            "spoken_text": "Urgency does not make an uncertain result reliable, or grant authority. If recording would delay the response, contain first, then complete the record. Record who decided what, on which facts and authority, how long the measure lasts, who takes over, and when to roll back. Then verify the correction on affected data and dependent uses, and review the cause. Treat a recurring kind of exception as a mechanism problem.",
